{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-title='Apache Tomcat'>\r\n\t\t\tApache Tomcat\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Database connection: Class.forName(\"com.microsoft.sqlserver.jdbc.SQLServerDriver\");.","label":"Database connection","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_xml","label":"Context.xml","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_xml"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/dump","label":"Dump","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/dump"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Class.forName(\"com.microsoft.sqlserver.jdbc.SQLServerDriver\");<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConnection con = DriverManager.getConnection(\"jdbc:sqlserver:\/\/localhost:1433;databaseName=NitgenAccessManager;user=Perm;password=^&amp;8&amp;^%8*Pe$!\");.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tStatement statement = con.createStatement() ;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tResultSet resultset = statement.executeQuery(\"select Top 10 * from NGAC_AUTHLOG\") ;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tResultset.next();.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPostgreSQL.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTry {.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tString driver = \"org.postgresql.Driver\";.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tString url = \"jdbc:postgresql:\/\/localhost:5432\/cpanelusername_dbname\";.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>String username = \"&lt;Username&gt;\";<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>String String password = \"&lt;Password&gt;\";<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tString myDataField = null;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tString myQuery = \"SELECT * FROM sample LIMIT 1\";.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConnection myConnection = null;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPreparedStatement myPreparedStatement = null;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tResultSet myResultSet = null;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tClass.forName(driver).newInstance();.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMyConnection = DriverManager.getConnection(url,username,password);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMyPreparedStatement = myConnection.prepareStatement(myQuery);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMyResultSet = myPreparedStatement.executeQuery();.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf(myResultSet.next()).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMyDataField = myResultSet.getString(\"dispname\");.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOut.print(myDataField);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t}.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCatch(ClassNotFoundException e){e.printStackTrace();}.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCatch (SQLException ex).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t{.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>out.print(\"SQLException.<\/strong> \"+ex.getMessage());.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>out.print(\"SQLState.<\/strong> \" + ex.getSQLState());.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>out.print(\"VendorError.<\/strong> \" + ex.getErrorCode());.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t}.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/database_connection\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/database_connection\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_xml' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_xml' data-title='Context.xml' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Context.xml<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/dump' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/dump' data-title='Dump' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Dump<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-title='Apache Tomcat'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Apache Tomcat<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}